      <p class="lead-text">
        Auto insurance premiums across the United States have undergone historic recalculations over the past 24 months. While vehicle owners frequently assume rate hikes stem entirely from their personal driving violations, the reality is rooted in macroeconomic loss costs filed by insurers with state insurance commissioners. 
      </p>

      <h2>National Average Auto Insurance Costs by Coverage Level</h2>
